<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>${sblg-get|title}</title>
    <meta charset="utf-8"/>
    <meta http-equiv="Expires" content="-1"/>
    <meta http-equiv="Pragma" content="no-cache"/>
    <meta http-equiv="Cache-Control" content="no-cache"/>
    <link href="css/profanity.css" type="text/css" rel="stylesheet"/>

    <script type="text/javascript" src="js/zoomer.js"></script>
</head>

<body id="landing">
    <section id="hero">
        <header>
            <img class="overlay" src="images/profanity_logo_mouth.svg" alt="Profanity Illustration" />
			<h1><span class="kern-ty">Profanity</span></h1>
            <h2>${sblg-get|subtitle}</h2>
        </header>
        <div id="intro">
            <p class="intro-lead">Profanity is a console based XMPP client written in C using <a href="http://www.gnu.org/software/ncurses/">ncurses</a> and <a href="http://strophe.im/libstrophe/">libstrophe</a>, inspired&nbsp;by&nbsp;<a href="http://irssi.org/">Irssi</a></p>
            <p class="intro-platforms">Available on Linux, FreeBSD, OpenBSD, OSX, Windows and Android (Termux)</p>
            <p class="intro-maintainer">Maintained by <a href="https://iodoru.org/">jubalh</a></p>
        </div>
    </section>
    <article data-sblg-article="1" style="position: relative"> Content</article>
    <div id="Zoomer" style="overflow-y:auto"></div>
    <footer>
        <ul class="footer-links">
            <li><a href="http://github.com/profanity-im/profanity">GitHub</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://lists.posteo.de/listinfo/profanity">Mailing List</a></li>
            <li><a href="https://x.com/profanityim">X (Twitter)</a></li>
            <li><a href="xmpp:profanity@rooms.dismail.de?join">XMPP Chat Room</a></li>
        </ul>
    </footer>
</body>

</html>
